title: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › The tab
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=actions
intro: The layout of the first tab: the cards on the left, the four buttons and the context you added on the right, and when each button is on or off. Each card and each button has its own diagram. Send to payer is in the header, once; what was decided here is in History.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Recommended actions'"
screen at "Recommended actions\nCards on the left, a narrow side panel on the right"

group gL "Left: the cards"
  screen fb "Chip 'Focus: Meet payer criteria' with an X 'Clear focus'\nOnly after 'Refine recommendations'"
  screen oc "Open cards, compact\nOne per recommendation not yet applied or dismissed\nAfter a refinement: in the new order, plus one marked 'Added for your focus'"
  screen ap "'Applied (6)' (only when something is applied)\nOne line each with a green tick and '+11 pts · applied'\nClick a line to open its bullets"
  screen dm "'Dismissed (1)' (only when something is dismissed)\nTitle struck through, the reason, 'Bring back'"
  toast ban "One line 'Every recommendation is applied'"
endgroup

group gR "Right: the side panel"
  process cnt "'6 of 6 selected' ('None open' when nothing is left)"
  click b1 "Click 'Apply selected (6)'"
  click b3 "Click 'Refine recommendations'"
  click b4 "Click 'Add clinical context'"
  click b5 "Click 'Dismiss recommendations'"
  screen cx "'Context you added'\nEach note with '+1 pt'\nOnly once a note is added"
endgroup

process off "Why a button is off\nApply and Dismiss: no card is included\nAll four: while the agents are updating the draft"
click tk "Click a card's checkbox or title to leave it out or put it back"
process up "'N of 6 selected' and 'Apply selected (N)' follow\nNothing is logged"
decision dAll "Is anything open?"
decision dApp "Is anything applied?"
process hs "Every dismissal, note, focus and added context lands in History at once\nflagged 'Logged decision'"

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › One card"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Apply selected"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Refine and add clinical context"
goto g6 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Add clinical context"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back"
goto g7 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › History"

s1 --> at
at --> dAll
at --> fb
dAll -->|Yes| oc --> g1
dAll -->|No| dApp
dApp -->|Yes| ban
dApp -->|No| cnt
at --> ap
at --> dm
at --> cnt
oc --> tk --> up --> cnt
cnt --> b1 --> g2
cnt --> b3 --> g4
cnt --> b4 --> g6
cnt --> b5 --> g5
cnt --> off
at --> cx
b5 -.-> hs
b4 -.-> hs
hs --> g7
